{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"301","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Yaroslav and Sequence"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yaroslav has an array, consisting of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2·n - 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers. In a single operation Yaroslav can change the sign of exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" elements in the array. In other words, in one operation Yaroslav can select exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" array elements, and multiply each of them by -1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yaroslav is now wondering: what maximum sum of array elements can be obtained if it is allowed to perform any number of described operations?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Yaroslav."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2 ≤ n ≤ 100)"},{"kind":"text","text":". The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(2·n - 1)"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers — the array elements. The array elements do not exceed "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1000"},{"kind":"text","text":" in their absolute value."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In a single line print the answer to the problem — the maximum sum that Yaroslav can get."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n50 50 50\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"150\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n-1 -100 -1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"100\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample you do not need to change anything. The sum of elements equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"150"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample you need to change the sign of the first two elements. Then we get the sum of the elements equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"100"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"301A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/301/problem/A"}